    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>;</mo><mo> </mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>, then range of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>∘</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></math> is",
